he matrices $A$ and ${e}^{At}$ above, compute $\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}({e}^{At}).$\n\n| $\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}({e}^{At})=\\,\\,$ |  | {{field-1}} | {{field-2}} |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  | {{field-3}} | {{field-4}} |  |  |" :question/worked-solution "Recall that \n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}({e}^{At})=A\\,{e}^{At}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}({e}^{At}) & =A\\,{e}^{At} \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-2 & 1 \\\\ 0 & -2\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}{e}^{-2t} & t{e}^{-2t} \\\\ 0 & {e}^{-2t}\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-2{e}^{-2t} & (1-2t){e}^{-2t} \\\\ 0 & -2{e}^{-2t}\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-335093/field-1" "q-335093/field-2" "q-335093/field-3" "q-335093/field-4"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "d4fc3ba4-d488-5156-88dc-837369269cef"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-335093"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-335096/field-1/5943125e1b62922d7d4701c38a9d6debde4afa0a8f9a1be8082eab400d155517" :answer/id #uuid "597174e2-b5b7-5561-a515-00882fb6b8fd" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-10\\sin(10t)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id 17592186220634 :answer-field/correct "q-335096/field-1/5943125e1b62922d7d4701c38a9d6debde4afa0a8f9a1be8082eab400d155517" :answer-field/choices ["q-335096/field-1/5943125e1b62922d7d4701c38a9d6debde4afa0a8f9a1be8082eab400d155517"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-335096/field-2/d8a60925dac4e0c115c3a549ac41a9b45e29277212ec5a6678b9cc8432414f2b" :answer/id #uuid "7952534c-adb1-5400-b40e-b252298e4d5a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-10\\cos(10t)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id 17592186220635 :answer-field/correct "q-335096/field-2/d8a60925dac4e0c115c3a549ac41a9b45e29277212ec5a6678b9cc8432414f2b" :answer-field/choices ["q-335096/field-2/d8a60925dac4e0c115c3a549ac41a9b45e2